# Database

- Drizzle schema in `src/db/schema/`. Migrations in `src/db/migrations/`. Never edit applied SQL by hand; generate a new migration.
- PKR and area columns are `numeric`. JS treats them as strings. Compute totals with `computeTotalPrice` (matches `unit_pricing` view).
- `sold_price_pkr` is frozen on sale. Do not recompute sold units from live rate.
- `units.unit_code` is unique per property. Optimistic lock on `units.version`.
- Status changes go through `changeUnitStatus` only: lock row, bump version, write `unit_status_history` and `audit_log` in the same transaction.
- Commands: `pnpm db:generate`, `pnpm db:migrate`, `pnpm db:seed`.
